{"id":"42a35510f5961e95","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-comb-independent-system.md","title":"ZFC Comb Independent System","display":"df-zfc-comb-independent-system — ZFC Comb Independent System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb-independent-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb-independent-system"],"display":"df-zfc-comb-independent-system — ZFC Comb Independent System","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb-independent-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb-independent-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb-independent-system — ZFC Comb Independent System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,X\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal A,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombIndependentSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombIndependentSystem}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}independent\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombIndependentSystem}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land \\forall F\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F\\neq\\varnothing)\\to \\forall \\epsilon\\in 2^F\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in F\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\epsilon(A)=1)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}independent\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombIndependentSystem}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land \\forall F\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F\\neq\\varnothing)\\to \\forall \\epsilon\\in 2^F\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in F\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\epsilon(A)=1)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The finite-subfamily test now uses the predicate exported by its dependency; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\epsilon,A,x\">\\(F,\\epsilon,A,x\\)</span> are assertion-bound variables rather than free hypothesis parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCombIndependentSystem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}independent\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombIndependentSystem}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land \\forall F\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land F\\neq\\varnothing)\\to \\forall \\epsilon\\in 2^F\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in F\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\epsilon(A)=1)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"F,\\epsilon,A,x","display":false}],"bytes":1104,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1642","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-comb-independent-system.md|58-df-zfc-comb-independent-system]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}